><highlight color="#9643FC" opacity="0.399994" creationdate="D:20250701101537+10'00'" flags="print" IT="HighlightNote" date="D:20250701101538+10'00'" name="4025d70c-1368-4ec6-8ca9-3520dd1cb705" page="16" coords="494.868713,345.982666,519.988770,345.982666,494.868713,333.768707,519.988770,333.768707,76.535004,332.473694,518.741394,332.473694,76.535004,320.259705,518.741394,320.259705,76.535004,318.963684,519.162659,318.963684,76.535004,306.749695,519.162659,306.749695,76.535004,305.454651,518.743042,305.454651,76.535004,293.240692,518.743042,293.240692,76.535004,291.944641,518.738953,291.944641,76.535004,279.730682,518.738953,279.730682,76.535004,278.435669,518.744934,278.435669,76.535004,266.221680,518.744934,266.221680,76.535004,264.926697,518.739990,264.926697,76.535004,252.712708,518.739990,252.712708,76.535004,251.416672,276.694031,251.416672,76.535004,239.202698,276.694031,239.202698" rect="76.153305,238.821014,520.370483,346.364349" subject="Comment on Text" title="Alexander Gibson"
><contents-richtext
><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:APIVersion="Acrobat:25.1.0" xfa:spec="2.0.2"
><p dir="ltr"
><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:-14.0pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal"
>Q14c: </span
><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:-13.3pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal"
>Thus,&#xD;the self-directed training intervention approach has limitations related to athlete motivation and the&#xD;lack of feedback during the learning process. Findings from the current qualitative responses, allow&#xD;researchers and practitioners to consider perceived barriers to training programs in future work with&#xD;high-school athletes. Youth sports practitioners and sporting organisations, therefore, may benefit&#xD;from prioritising face-to-face coaching delivery during the early phases of acquiring competency in&#xD;strength training techniques, while continuing to record and reflect on the thoughts of the participants&#xD;after such physical preparation interventions.</span
></p
></body
></contents-richtext
><popup flags="print,nozoom,norotate" open="no" page="16" rect="595.276001,253.982666,779.276001,345.982666"
/></highlight
